OL,3,GNEWSAMarathon cancelled and parks
OL,4,Aclosed as storm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA half marathon has been postponed and
OL,7,Fparks closed across the East Midlands
OL,8,Fas Storm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,9,Fdisruption, and power cuts to parts of
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FWorksop Half Marathon, which takes
OL,13,Frunners through Clumber Park in
OL,14,FNottinghamshire, was called off after
OL,15,Fthe park closed due to forecasted high
OL,16,Fwinds on Sunday.
OL,18,FA yellow weather warning for wind
OL,19,Fremains in place until 21:00 GMT on
OL,20,FSunday for parts of north
OL,21,FNottinghamshire and north Derbyshire.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
