OL,3,GNEWSAMarathon cancelled and parks
OL,4,Aclosed as storm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office said widespread gusts of
OL,7,F60mph to 70mph were forecast within the
OL,8,Fwarning area in other parts of the UK,
OL,9,Fwhile gusts of over 50mph were likely
OL,10,Fin the East Midlands.
